ing to share your thoughts or show a demo with friends, colleagues or students. \nPass the quiz during watching a manual to make sure you know the topic well.\nThis application is perfectly suitable for educational, informational and entertaining purposes.", "short_description": "Cloyd is a cross-platform solution created by a team of talented developers, to provide interaction with 3D content on a completely new level.\nIn our app you\u2019re able not only view 3D models and manuals but also interact with them in various ways.\nThis application is perfectly suitable for educational, informational and entertaining purposes."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cloydixr.com/application-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://cloydixr.com/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "UAB Cloyd IXR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://cloydxr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "7288565814506150"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982526_772035178011054_1516527906370566874_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VBDyYu9VutcQ7kNvwFZx3Rd&_nc_oc=AdqdJDXrJ18zveB6b_4lj-uKqbrgxog0r5NwtWR54O2NRILiJ_z_G9oTdmWE3fTUaqY&_nc_zt=3&_nc